WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:05,150
Boss, let me take a look at this

2
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:06,650
Okay, what do you need me to do?

3
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:08,150
No, can we give it a try?

4
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:09,150
I know this car relatively well

5
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:11,150
But I have to try how it actually drives.

6
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:12,150
And this is what I, Brother Xiao, bought.

7
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:13,150
No problem

8
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:19,980
I'm going to get the key now for you to try

9
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:20,980
Two cars of this style

10
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:22,980
Are there any cable cars?

11
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:25,370
Okay, let's get two cars

12
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:27,530
By the way, you need to provide your ID card

13
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:29,530
Can I borrow your ID card?

14
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:32,530
Brother Xiao, of course you can lend me my ID card to buy a car.

15
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:33,530
But from a legal perspective

16
00:00:33,530 --> 00:00:34,530
Play my cards from now on

17
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:35,530
That's my garage

18
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:36,530
You think carefully

19
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:38,530
It's okay, just use your ID card

20
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:40,530
The two cars cost a total of 13,200 yuan.

21
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:47,300
Brother Xiao, let’s keep a low profile

22
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:49,300
We have to work harder, right?

23
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,300
Yes, now let's go to the gas station and fill it up

24
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,300
How long does it last after filling up?

25
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:55,300
About two hundred kilometers
